---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import BrandLogo from '../components/BrandLogo.astro';
import { siteConfig } from '../data/site';
---
<BaseLayout site={siteConfig} title="Privacy notice | La La Land Nail Hub" description="How La La Land Nail Hub uses your appointment details, inspiration images and contact permission.">
  <main id="main" class="privacy-page">
    <a href="/" aria-label="La La Land Nail Hub home"><BrandLogo compact /></a>
    <p class="eyebrow">La La Land Nail Hub</p>
    <h1>Privacy notice</h1>
    <p>When you request a manicure, we use your details to discuss and arrange your appointment. This notice explains what is collected, who can access it and how to raise a privacy question.</p>
    <h2>What the form collects</h2>
    <p>Your name, phone number, call or text preference, requested date and two-hour time block, selected service and add-ons, a price estimate, optional inspiration links and images, optional appointment note and the time you give permission to be contacted. The website also records a general source label, such as Google or Instagram, when available. This label does not include the referring page, search terms or campaign identifiers.</p>
    <h2>Why we use it</h2>
    <p>Bianca uses your request to respond, discuss your nails and arrange an appointment. Permission to respond to an enquiry does not sign you up for promotional messages. Please leave medical information, payment card details and other sensitive information out of the note.</p>
    <h2>Where requests go</h2>
    <p>Requests are saved in the private staff workspace hosted on Cloudflare. The website also attempts to send an email notification to Bianca’s business inbox. Authorised staff can review requests and maintain related appointment and client records. Hosting and email providers process information as part of delivering these services.</p>
    <h2>Inspiration images and links</h2>
    <p>Images are stored privately with your request and are available only to authorised studio staff. Images are not used as public portfolio material or marketing consent. Your browser prepares smaller JPEG copies before upload. External inspiration links are not fetched automatically; staff may open them to review your ideas. Please avoid images containing faces, medical details or other sensitive personal information.</p>
    <h2>Saved records</h2>
    <p>Enquiry and appointment records remain in the staff workspace after a request is handled; closing or archiving a request does not erase it. If you want to ask about access, correction, withdrawal of contact permission or deletion, contact Bianca through the request form and mention that you have a privacy question. You do not need to include private details in that message.</p>
    <h2>Website operation</h2>
    <p>The hosting provider processes technical request information to deliver and protect the website. Staff sign-in is restricted using Cloudflare Access. A private studio calendar subscription contains appointment times and generic event titles; it excludes client names, contact details and private notes. Requested blocks appear as tentative events.</p>
    <p>To protect availability, requests are limited per network connection using a daily hashed network identifier. The limit expires within 24 hours, and expired identifiers are cleared when the next form request is processed. We do not store your raw IP address in the booking database.</p>
    <a class="button" href="/#booking">Contact Bianca</a>
    <a class="text-link" href="/">Back to the website</a>
</main>
</BaseLayout>
<style>
  .privacy-page { max-width: 48rem; margin: auto; padding: 2rem 1.5rem 5rem; }
  .privacy-page :global(.brand-logo) { max-width: 12rem; margin-bottom: 2rem; }
  h1 { font-size: clamp(2.5rem,7vw,4rem); }
  h2 { font-size: 1.6rem; margin: 2rem 0 .75rem; }
  p { margin: 1rem 0; line-height: 1.75; }
  .button { margin: 2rem 1rem 1rem 0; }
</style>
